<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Thank you:</span> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548004922" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;">Ihp</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/multizig" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3740504); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3740504&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548004922" alt="multizig" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3740504)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/multizig" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3740504); return false;">multizig</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meserach" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1507289); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1507289&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548004922" alt="Meserach" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1507289)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/meserach" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1507289); return false;">Meserach</a></span></p>
